---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Best Restaurants in Burgas | Where to Eat During Eurovision 2027" 
  description="Discover the best restaurants in Burgas for Eurovision 2027. From fresh Black Sea seafood and traditional Bulgarian mehanas to upscale dining."
  breadcrumb="Restaurants"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 class="text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Where to Eat in Burgas: The Eurovision Dining Guide</h1>
      
      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        Burgas offers a fantastic culinary scene that blends Balkan traditions, Mediterranean influences, and incredible Black Sea seafood. During Eurovision, the best spots will be fully booked weeks in advance.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>Seafood & Sea Views (Sea Garden / Port Area)</h2>
        <p>You cannot visit Burgas without trying the local Black Sea mussels, fried tsatsa (sprat), and fresh turbot.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Dalyana:</strong> A legendary spot for unpretentious, incredibly fresh fish right by the water.</li>
          <li><strong>Neptun:</strong> An iconic building in the Sea Garden. Upscale Mediterranean and seafood with panoramic sea views.</li>
          <li><strong>Flora Bar & Grill:</strong> Great ambiance, modern European menu, located centrally in the Sea Garden.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>Traditional Bulgarian (Mehanas)</h2>
        <p>Experience local hospitality, shopska salad, grilled meats, and rakia in a traditional tavern setting.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Tenishia (Тенекиите):</strong> Famous among locals for massive portions of grilled meats and authentic atmosphere.</li>
          <li><strong>Ethno:</strong> Located on the main pedestrian street (Aleksandrovska). A modern take on traditional Bulgarian and Mediterranean.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass-panel mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);">
        <h3>Need Guaranteed Reservations?</h3>
        <p>If you are traveling with a large group or delegation, walking in to top restaurants during Eurovision week will be impossible. We secure prime tables for our B2B and Concierge clients.</p>
        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/concierge" class="btn btn-secondary">Book via Concierge</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
